+# Setup Passport: przemek-nowicki/node-express-template.ts
+
+🟡 **PARTIAL**: FirstRun followed this project's setup docs on a clean `node:16` machine, repaired what broke, then replayed the corrected guide from zero.
+
+| | |
+|---|---|
+| Commit | `d731e5cef4` |
+| Verified | 2026-09-24 22:20 UTC |
+| Runtime | Node.js 16 (`node:16`) |
+| Clone to running, from zero | **1m00s** |
+| Steps followed | 2 from the docs, 1 added by FirstRun |
+| Breaks found / fixed | 2 / 0 |
+| Needs a human | 1 |
+| Done when | `npm test` passes |
+
+**Before FirstRun**, a newcomer following the docs got stuck at `npm test` (README.md:90).
+
+## Verified setup
+
+```bash
+docker-compose up
+npm install
+```
+
+## Evidence
+
+Every change to the docs is backed by a command that failed before the fix and passed after it.
+
+### E1: Missing or out-of-order step <a id="e1"></a>
+
+- **Docs said:** `npm test` (README.md:90)
+- **Cause:** Dependencies were never installed before "npm test"; the docs skip `npm install`.
+- **Diagnosed by:** FirstRun rule `deps-not-installed`, confidence 90%
+- **Doc change:** npm install
+- **Result:** fix did not work
+
+<details><summary>Before (failing output)</summary>
+
+```
+
+> net.ts@1.1.5 test
+> jest -c jest.config.js --env=node
+
+sh: 1: jest: not found
+```
+</details>
+
+<details><summary>Fix applied</summary>
+
+```
+$ npm install → exit 0
+```
+</details>
+
+<details><summary>After (passing output)</summary>
+
+```
+      31 |   );
+
+      at Object.<anonymous> (src/config/config.ts:28:9)
+      at Object.<anonymous> (src/core/utils/httpLogger.ts:4:1)
+
+Test Suites: 5 failed, 1 passed, 6 total
